{"game": "roboquest", "language": "english", "appid": 692890, "month": "2020-09", "window": 1, "start_date": 1598918400, "end_date": 1599523199, "month_true_total": 83, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-03 01:47:43 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "75612373", "author": {"steamid": "76561198039302658", "personaname": "6th God Zorrotsu Nagarra", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198039302658/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 992, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 251, "last_played": 1728243933, "avatar": "f2b60c9fa9a2e708f25f988b453ce3938933f834"}, "language": "english", "review": "Now this is my kind of Rougelite.\nFast paced\nTight movement control\nGunplay feels smooth\nDeaths don't feel unfair or something you cant learn from.\nWould likely recommend if you need something to play and enjoy a good shooter run. \nWeapons feel different and all of them can be viable with certain perks.\nOn the down side there are only 4 stages and I've probably only seen about 20 guns in game. That really isnt a bad thing, but I do want a little more content on that side. \nOverall 8/10", "timestamp_created": 1599506851, "timestamp_updated": 1599506851, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "75586424", "author": {"steamid": "76561197975941251", "personaname": "viralinfection", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197975941251/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 1069, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 194, "last_played": 1624066320, "avatar": "2a849cbb5cd39d64af11ec7e985e4adde38784b5"}, "language": "english", "review": "Good game. Fun movement, Gunfire+Borderlands feel, makes the mechanics its own and adds some new ones. Not a lot of content right now and expected early access issues, still worth the purchase if you're looking for another FPS roguelite.", "timestamp_created": 1599468499, "timestamp_updated": 1599468499, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.525862038135528564", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "75570620", "author": {"steamid": "76561198011684002", "personaname": "Panda Actual", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ZetraThorn/", "num_games_owned": 390, "num_reviews": 24, "playtime_forever": 3619, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 303, "last_played": 1732812429, "avatar": "bedad3c5976a21cf641761836d8691d10721fc6d"}, "language": "english", "review": "So far game looks really promising. Gunplay is nice comic book aesthetics is really nice touch. Music is really good, with the downside being that it gets repetitive.\n\nThe only downside so far is repetition and variety however That will be adressed at some point as the game is in development still.\n\nI think the game would benefit from level variation. So for example lvl 1 would have two different tilesets instead of being one and the same each and every time.\n", "timestamp_created": 1599438129, "timestamp_updated": 1599438129, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "75558625", "author": {"steamid": "76561198039114254", "personaname": "cat", "person